//│ >     Infix:
//│ >       op = Keyword(`=`, 16, 16)
//│ >       lhs = Reference of "empty"
//│ >       rhs = Bracketed#Square of Sequence of Nil
//│ > Define:
//│ >   kind = Let(true)
//│ >   items = Stack of 
